{%- doc -%}
  The product page, in the same posture as the homepage.

  Gallery on one side, and on the other the five things a decision is made
  with: the name, the problem the product answers, the price, one button and
  one line about delivery. The problem and answer pair comes from the product's
  own metafields, so nothing here is written by the section.

  The price, the button and the shipping line sit inside one bordered panel,
  the way Chewy separates what a thing is from buying it. On a phone that panel
  is what you land on after the gallery.

  The thumbnail strip is one swipeable row rather than two wrapped ones. Eight
  thumbnails on two rows cost about 90px of height directly above the price,
  which is the last thing worth pushing down a phone screen.

  Below 900px the buy box is a screen and a bit under the fold, so the page also
  carries a fixed bar with the price and the same button. It is the second form
  on the page and posts the same variant; nothing about it is conditional on
  JavaScript.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign media = product.media | where: 'media_type', 'image'
  assign hero = product.featured_media
  if hero == blank and media.size > 0
    assign hero = media.first
  endif
  assign problem = product.metafields.custom.problem_line.value
  assign solution = product.metafields.custom.solution_line.value
  assign highlights = product.metafields.custom.highlights.value
  assign spotlight = product.metafields.custom.spotlight.value

  assign perk_n = 0
  if section.settings.perk_1 != blank
    assign perk_n = perk_n | plus: 1
  endif
  if section.settings.perk_2 != blank
    assign perk_n = perk_n | plus: 1
  endif
  if section.settings.perk_3 != blank
    assign perk_n = perk_n | plus: 1
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  The perks strip, the first thing under the header on a product page.

  It lives inside this section rather than in a section of its own for one
  reason: the catalogue has ten product templates, and three text settings with
  schema defaults reach all ten without editing a single template file. A
  separate section would have meant adding a block to each of the ten and
  remembering the tenth.

  The defaults are therefore what is true of every product in the shop. The
  30 day guarantee is not: it covers Bloom alone, so Bloom's template overrides
  these three and no other page claims it.

  Three settings written out rather than a loop over an array built from them,
  because building that array starts from splitting an empty string and the two
  Liquid engines in play do not have to agree on whether that is an empty array
  or an array holding one empty string. Three ifs cannot be wrong.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if perk_n > 0 -%}
  <section class="wf-perks">
    <ul class="wf-perks__list" role="list" style="--wf-perks-n: {{ perk_n }};">
      {%- if section.settings.perk_1 != blank -%}
        <li class="wf-perks__i">{{ section.settings.perk_1 }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.perk_2 != blank -%}
        <li class="wf-perks__i">{{ section.settings.perk_2 }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.perk_3 != blank -%}
        <li class="wf-perks__i">{{ section.settings.perk_3 }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}
    </ul>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}

<div class="pl-wrap">
  <div class="wf-pdp">
    <div>
      <div class="wf-pdp__stage">
        {%- if hero != blank -%}
          <img
            id="wf-stage"
            src="{{ hero | image_url: width: 1100 }}"
            srcset="{{ hero | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ hero | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w"
            sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 52vw"
            width="{{ hero.preview_image.width }}"
            height="{{ hero.preview_image.height }}"
            alt="{{ hero.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          >
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if media.size > 1 -%}
        <ul class="wf-pdp__thumbs" role="list">
          {%- for item in media -%}
            <li>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="wf-pdp__thumb"
                aria-current="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                aria-label="תמונה {{ forloop.index }} מתוך {{ media.size }}"
                data-src="{{ item | image_url: width: 1100 }}"
                data-srcset="{{ item | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ item | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w"
              >
                <img src="{{ item | image_url: width: 180 }}" width="{{ item.preview_image.width }}" height="{{ item.preview_image.height }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </button>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1 class="wf-pdp__title">{{ product.title }}</h1>

      {%- if problem != blank -%}
        <p class="wf-flag__problem">{{ problem }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if solution != blank -%}
        <p class="wf-sub">{{ solution }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- render 'wf-rating', product: product, settings: section.settings -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The selling points sit above the buy box, not below it.

        A price and a button reached before the reader knows what the thing is
        asks for a decision that has not been earned yet. These four or five
        lines are the shortest honest answer to "what am I buying", so they go
        in front of the money and the long argument stays behind it. The band
        further down no longer repeats them.

        Two shapes, because one list serves two jobs. The tick list is the
        default and reads as prose. The tiles are for a product whose points
        are four short attributes rather than four sentences: they are scanned
        rather than read, which is the whole reason to spend an icon on them.
        The icon per row comes from the section settings, so a product that
        rewrites its highlights never silently keeps an icon that no longer
        matches.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        comment
          The tiles carry their own four labels rather than reusing the
          highlights. Those are sentences, and a sentence in an 85 pixel tile
          on a phone runs to three cramped lines: rendered against the current
          four it is worse than the tick list it replaces. A tile wants two or
          three words, which is a different piece of copy about the same
          product, not the same piece of copy in a different shape.

          The labels fall back to the highlights when none are set, so a
          product switched to tiles before anyone writes them shows something
          rather than an empty row.
        endcomment
        assign tiles = ''
        if section.settings.tile_1 != blank
          assign tiles = section.settings.tile_1 | append: '|' | append: section.settings.tile_2 | append: '|' | append: section.settings.tile_3 | append: '|' | append: section.settings.tile_4 | split: '|'
        else
          assign tiles = highlights
        endif
      -%}
      {%- if section.settings.points_above and tiles.size > 0 -%}
        {%- if section.settings.points_style == 'tiles' -%}
          <ul class="wf-tiles" role="list">
            {%- for line in tiles -%}
              {%- liquid
                case forloop.index
                  when 1
                    assign ic = section.settings.icon_1
                  when 2
                    assign ic = section.settings.icon_2
                  when 3
                    assign ic = section.settings.icon_3
                  else
                    assign ic = section.settings.icon_4
                endcase
              -%}
              <li class="wf-tile">
                <span class="wf-tile__i" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'wf-icon', name: ic -%}</span>
                <span class="wf-tile__t">{{ line }}</span>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- else -%}
          <ul class="wf-points wf-points--lede" role="list">
            {%- for line in highlights -%}
              <li><span class="wf-points__mark" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span><span>{{ line }}</span></li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The three numbers, directly above the price.

        custom.spotlight was written for three products and rendered nowhere.
        It is the only place in the record that states a figure a shopper can
        compare: a 30 centimetre head against a 12, 2.5 times the coverage,
        zero refills. Those are the lines that separate three fur removers that
        otherwise read as the same product at three prices, and a shopper who
        cannot tell them apart does not pick one, they leave.

        It sits immediately above the buy box for the same reason the
        highlights do: it answers "why this one" in the glance before the
        price, not in a band below it.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if spotlight.size > 0 -%}
        <ul class="wf-spot" role="list">
          {%- for item in spotlight -%}
            <li class="wf-spot__i">
              <span class="wf-spot__v">{{ item.value }}</span>
              <span class="wf-spot__l">{{ item.label }}</span>
              {%- if item.note != blank -%}
                <span class="wf-spot__n">{{ item.note }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- render 'wf-buybox', product: product, settings: section.settings -%}

      {%- if product.description != blank -%}
        <div class="wf-pdp__rte">{{ product.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wf-buybar">
  {%- comment -%}
    The bar carries the thumbnail and the name because it is the only part of
    the page still on screen after a long scroll, and a lone price with a
    button is a price for something the reader has to remember.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if product.featured_image -%}
    <img
      class="wf-buybar__img"
      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 140 }}"
      width="56"
      height="56"
      alt=""
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    >
  {%- endif -%}
  <span class="wf-buybar__meta">
    <span class="wf-buybar__name">{{ product.title | truncate: 28 }}</span>
    <span class="wf-buybar__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
  </span>
  {%- form 'product', product, class: 'wf-buybar__form' -%}
    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
    <button type="submit" class="wf-btn wf-buybar__btn" {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
      {%- if product.available -%}{{ section.settings.atc_label }}{%- else -%}אזל מהמלאי{%- endif -%}
    </button>
  {%- endform -%}
</div>
<div class="wf-buybar__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

{%- if media.size > 1 -%}
  <script>
    (function () {
      var stage = document.getElementById('wf-stage');
      var thumbs = document.querySelectorAll('.wf-pdp__thumb');
      if (!stage || !thumbs.length) return;
      thumbs.forEach(function (btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          stage.srcset = btn.dataset.srcset;
          stage.src = btn.dataset.src;
          thumbs.forEach(function (other) { other.setAttribute('aria-current', other === btn ? 'true' : 'false'); });
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "תמות · דף מוצר",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "atc_label", "label": "כפתור הקנייה", "default": "הוספה לסל" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "note", "label": "שורה מתחת לכפתור", "default": "משלוחים לכל הארץ · 14 יום לביטול עסקה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "price_note", "label": "שורה ליד המחיר", "default": "" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "swatch_label", "label": "כותרת בורר הצבעים", "default": "בחרו צבע" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "points_above", "label": "נקודות המכירה מעל הכפתור", "default": true },
    { "type": "select", "id": "points_style", "label": "צורת נקודות המכירה", "default": "check",
      "options": [
        { "value": "check", "label": "רשימת וי" },
        { "value": "tiles", "label": "ארבעה אייקונים בשורה" }
      ] },
    { "type": "header", "content": "ארבעת האריחים" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tile_1", "label": "תווית ראשונה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tile_2", "label": "תווית שנייה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tile_3", "label": "תווית שלישית" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tile_4", "label": "תווית רביעית" },
    { "type": "select", "id": "icon_1", "label": "אייקון ראשון", "default": "paw",
      "options": [
        { "value": "paw", "label": "כפה" },
        { "value": "shield", "label": "מגן" },
        { "value": "fold", "label": "קיפול" },
        { "value": "heart", "label": "לב" },
        { "value": "truck", "label": "משלוח" },
        { "value": "ruler", "label": "מידות" },
        { "value": "sparkle", "label": "ניקיון" }
      ] },
    { "type": "select", "id": "icon_2", "label": "אייקון שני", "default": "shield",
      "options": [
        { "value": "paw", "label": "כפה" },
        { "value": "shield", "label": "מגן" },
        { "value": "fold", "label": "קיפול" },
        { "value": "heart", "label": "לב" },
        { "value": "truck", "label": "משלוח" },
        { "value": "ruler", "label": "מידות" },
        { "value": "sparkle", "label": "ניקיון" }
      ] },
    { "type": "select", "id": "icon_3", "label": "אייקון שלישי", "default": "fold",
      "options": [
        { "value": "paw", "label": "כפה" },
        { "value": "shield", "label": "מגן" },
        { "value": "fold", "label": "קיפול" },
        { "value": "heart", "label": "לב" },
        { "value": "truck", "label": "משלוח" },
        { "value": "ruler", "label": "מידות" },
        { "value": "sparkle", "label": "ניקיון" }
      ] },
    { "type": "select", "id": "icon_4", "label": "אייקון רביעי", "default": "heart",
      "options": [
        { "value": "paw", "label": "כפה" },
        { "value": "shield", "label": "מגן" },
        { "value": "fold", "label": "קיפול" },
        { "value": "heart", "label": "לב" },
        { "value": "truck", "label": "משלוח" },
        { "value": "ruler", "label": "מידות" },
        { "value": "sparkle", "label": "ניקיון" }
      ] },
    { "type": "header", "content": "הדירוג מתחת לכותרת" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reviews_label", "label": "הטקסט שאחרי המספר", "default": "ביקורות לקוחות" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "out_of", "label": "תיאור הדירוג לקוראי מסך", "default": "מתוך 5 כוכבים" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reviews_anchor", "label": "קישור לסקשן הביקורות", "default": "#shopify-section-reviews" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "רצועת היתרונות שמעל העמוד" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "perk_1", "label": "יתרון ראשון", "default": "🚚 משלוחים לכל הארץ" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "perk_2", "label": "יתרון שני", "default": "14 יום לביטול עסקה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "perk_3", "label": "יתרון שלישי", "default": "תמיכה בעברית, לפני ואחרי" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "תמות · דף מוצר" }]
}
{% endschema %}
